# and linked against the generated resolver (make check-css-grammars); what does not compile, and every initial value that does
# not parse, is listed here. An unlisted failure fails the gate, and so does an entry that is no longer true (the gap closed, the
# text changed, the pin raised): a listed entry is a statement about the pin and is removed with the gap.
